--------------------------------------------------
AMANDA Dump Pre-Checkups 
----------------------------------------------------

1) lsscsi -g need to verify physical tape disk is read by server or not

2) mtx -f /dev/sch0 status verify tape disk it should be in drive state only.

3) Load the tapes for backup purpose
mtx -f /dev/sch0 load 1 0
mtx -f /dev/sch0 load 2 1

4) Verify configurations for Amanda with
amcheck DailySet1

5) Need to add gnuter dump type for all permissions, previlages and symbolic link
# Dumptypes for gnutar
define dumptype root-tar {
global
program "GNUTAR"
comment "root partitions dumped with tar"
compress none
index  yes
# Add these two lines below:
holdingdisk no
estimate calcsize
priority low
}

6) Need to update the disk list with as below.
localhost /staging/ada_home root-tar


7) Need to label both slots before dumping
amlabel -f DailySet1 TAPE-ADAUSERBACKUP-01 slot 1
amlabel -f DailySet1 TAPE-ADAUSERBACKUP-02 slot 2

8) Need to run Dump command as 
amdump DailySet1

9) For dump monitering purpose we need to use
watch -n 1 amstatus DailySet1

------------------------------------------
Physical Tape disk eject steps
------------------------------------------

Need to unload and tape first for both slot 1 and slot 2
mtx -f /dev/sch0 unload 1 0
mtx -f /dev/sch0 unload 2 1

Need to transfer the tape disks from drive slot to mail slot
mtx -f /dev/sch0 transfer 1 36
mtx -f /dev/sch0 transfer 2 37

Verify tape disk is in mail slot with below command
mtx -f /dev/sch0 status
------------------------------------------------------
Physical Tape Disk data restoration steps
------------------------------------------------------

Need to move the tapes from mail slot to drive slot

mtx -f /dev/sch0 transfer 36 1
mtx -f /dev/sch0 transfer 37 2

Verify tape disk in drive slot with below command
mtx -f /dev/sch0 status

run the restoration command

amrestore -p /dev/nst0 localhost /staging/ada_home | sudo tar -xvp --same-owner -f -